      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KIANDO ESTATE (3) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Gunnedah in a handy 20.09 beating Burnside Matt. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Great chance again. ASTON JOE (1) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind FEAR NOT FRANKY (18.98) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Bold showing expected. ADA TARO (4) has missed the placings at her last couple but was in the money three back when second (18.65) at this track in a Grade 4. Has good speed and can quickly clear the tricky draw. Can feature with the right run. MASTER LEHIGH (2) placed last time and is worth some thought.",
